create_manifest syncs the active file with a bare fdatasync, and a failure
throws without degrading. The pages the failed sync left clean are written by
no later fdatasync (#231), so the next sync write moves durable_sequence over
writes a power cut then loses. Reverts #282 (#281).
Guarded-by: "create_manifest whose fdatasync fails degrades, and a power cut keeps everything below durable_sequence"

